5 ([https://supremevalues.com/mm2/ Supreme])|theme=legendary}}'''Emberknife''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that is currently obtainable by purchasing the 29th tier of the [[Halloween Event 2026]] for 600 candies {{Currency|Candies2026}}and 16800 candies in total. 

== Appearance ==
Emberknife features an orange textured blade with a purple handle which goes further into the blade, covering the base of the knife.

== Trivia ==
This knife partners with the legendary gun [[Embergun]], and shares the same Ember- prefix as the rest of the weapons of [[Legendary Weapons|Legendary]] and above rarity from the [[Halloween Event 2026]].

